+# TAHAI Web Services spider asset
+
+`tahai_web_services_spider_256.png` is the authoritative TAHAI Web Services
+website favicon master. Its geometry is a locked brand asset: do not trace,
+redraw, simplify, regenerate, recolor, mask, or reinterpret the spider.
+
+Source at import time:
+`TWS WEBSITE/favicon/favicon-256.png`
+
+SHA-256:
+`21D9B79F49523C4CA476E5CC02CAA2D8F45FBF6E07D9779B417DBFFD5FF7ECE9`
+
+The browser's matching 16, 32, 64, 128, and 256 pixel resources are copied
+directly from the website favicon set. Legacy 22, 24, 44, and 150 pixel slots
+are proportional raster derivatives because the website does not provide
+those exact sizes.
